{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "e38929a12629dc8674dc89feaf06a0cf37067de861df939ac5b3b088f298e992", "ja": "う～ん、こうかな？　それともこんな感じ？\nうぅ～、あんまり似てないような……。", "zh": "嗯……是这样吗？还是这样？\n唔～看起来不太像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d3873409c212f99c972a614c900c7f94a261fb4302e37c1ecf703d2815e43fd4", "ja": "春香、ブログの更新お疲れさま。\n……ところで、何してるんだ？", "zh": "春香，更新部落格辛苦了。\n……是说你在做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "1ad00311e9111c3862f223854b4f7431bfc9555edf931bae1b306ad6d1e053d2", "ja": "ひゃ！？　{$P$}さん！？\nびっくりした～。も、もしかして見られちゃいました？", "zh": "呀啊！？{$P$}先生！？\n吓我一跳～难、难不成你看到了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1003_p", "source_sha256": "af9c9a7f3dce2b5d32de9c84376827bb59abd0be02bd0397bc5261287202ef61", "ja": "いや、よく分からなかったけど……。\n何か悩み事でもあるのか？", "zh": "没有，我不晓得你在做什么……\n是有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "d8552842c6ddde836271a9be89e02fea3a4b773d3d7a415f3ff66197d628d940", "ja": "悩みというか……。えっと、実は昨日の夜、\nライブの参考にと思って、羊の動画を見てたんです。", "zh": "这该算是烦恼吗……那个，老实说，\n我昨晚看了绵羊的影片，想说可以当演唱会的参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bc2a6bcee055a020be40f453db99d57e032dd0056ff82e7c4901a47dc6c09847", "ja": "羊の動画……なかなかマニアックそうな……。\nで、参考になったのか？", "zh": "绵羊的影片……钻研得还真深啊……\n所以，你觉得有帮助吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "365849dc1b3dde3564524c0a01dabc9a8cae118b2388de78116c00c11fc149f1", "ja": "はい♪　ふわふわモコモコの羊がいっぱいで、\n思わずモフモフしたくなっちゃいました。", "zh": "嗯♪很多软绵绵又毛茸茸的绵羊，\n让我不禁好想摸摸牠们呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "ef25261e4ed064a2b2ecba7b481dffc2907a123e08477ae88db840cc7049e8e3", "ja": "ただ、たくさん見すぎたせいか、\n羊の無表情っぽい顔が、頭から離れなくって……。", "zh": "不过，不晓得是不是因为看太久了，\n绵羊那张面无表情的脸，在脑海里挥之不去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1008_p", "source_sha256": "24f96a0755c005cf48171227b7afabcbddacc3733dff5314f92a7eba610cfa79", "ja": "まあ……確かに、何とも味のある顔してるからな。\nって、それが悩みだったのか？", "zh": "嗯……绵羊的脸确实有牠的特色呢。\n所以你是在烦恼这个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "0a0a0e97781532f34c829bb99c29a752e9dbc494517546413bf5a6c5f3b278c2", "ja": "あ、いえ。羊って、それでもなんだかかわいいんです。\nそのかわいさを、取り入れたいんですけど～。", "zh": "啊，不是的。绵羊就算面无表情，看起来还是很可爱。\n我是希望能将这种可爱放进演唱会里～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "bac8300d2ef5ea8f2563b041cfd4a5bc5385558d450b545a69642826655e014f", "ja": "羊らしくしようって、私がマネしようとしても、\nどうもヘンな顔になっちゃって……。", "zh": "但我自己试着模仿了绵羊的表情，\n看起来也只是怪里怪气的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1011_p", "source_sha256": "14f7e2f58f6b401ef6ffc7a3c6f775a3b2a3e22548486eec17a830d89bf62abb", "ja": "なるほど。それでさっきは顔マネしてたのか。\n……でも、ちょっと考えすぎかもな。", "zh": "原来如此，所以你刚才是在模仿绵羊的表情啊。\n……不过，我觉得你可能想太多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "a06eb54410c5d770a267acdd7d1a0fd9d7237cc5e8124a855d291e4d43a70e7f", "ja": "そ、そうですか？", "zh": "是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9e3e91d7207103908a272b8a0748576681a1c9d0f3a21fe262bb97cb99900b02", "ja": "衣装は羊モチーフだけど、お客さんが\n見たいのは、羊じゃなくて春香なんだから。", "zh": "服装的设计主题虽然是绵羊，\n但观众想看的是春香，而不是绵羊啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1014_p", "source_sha256": "468690c5bf15e048ef5df524eef1e123c94ca611911738e5cddaaa126f7bb2e1", "ja": "羊らしくじゃなくて、春香らしく。いつもの春香で\nいたほうが、お客さんの喜ぶ春香になると思うよ。", "zh": "所以不用去模仿绵羊，发挥自己的特色就好。\n我想观众喜欢的，还是平常那个春香喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "226f849136996d006f736215bbd1e6ec2dd36a3c17bffbb3cd37ac9c009c5022", "ja": "私らしく、ですか。\nえっと、犬かきが得意とか、1日3回転ぶとか……？", "zh": "发挥自己的特色吗……\n我想想……像是狗爬式或是一天会跌倒三次这种……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1016_p", "source_sha256": "41108e693387ab3d41264834301f4d7cb4d4642b157451643ec055e3795e7d64", "ja": "それをライブでやるわけには……。\nそうじゃなくて、笑顔。ほら、いつもの笑顔！　な？", "zh": "演唱会可不能让你做这些事情……\n不对啦，我指的是笑容。就是你平常的笑容啦！懂吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "7bb39bfe8fad87156a5fb9191e8bf386e894d1c833077fcf3a37a60070d8fcdc", "ja": "笑顔……。\nえへへ♪　って、こんな感じかな……？", "zh": "笑容……\n嘿嘿♪像这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6fdf5aee2deac502e3faaa4d721a9a738ccf06c31c8316f5044ba631e2142ddb", "ja": "うん、それでこそ春香だ。\n春香らしくて、かわいい！", "zh": "嗯，这样才是春香。\n充满春香的风格，很可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "45c19beecc656f1f543c31c1279bfe0893d6b62cca5dcaf03adf677189ab982f", "ja": "わ、本当ですか？\nよかった～、ありがとうございますっ！", "zh": "哇，真的吗？\n太好了～谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "917cae899f686eb7e96dfebe17a65a98d09eae7022ec93d227fafb0f2d205c1e", "ja": "迷ってたけど、すっきりしました！　やっぱり\n{$P$}さんって、頼りになりますね♪", "zh": "虽然烦恼了很久，但我现在想通了！\n{$P$}先生果然很可靠呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3931186b19949a15c0c684014e760d60e297f98e2933688cba020cca752abdca", "ja": "いやいや。……ところで春香、\n実際どんな顔マネやってたんだ？", "zh": "哪里哪里……是说春香，\n你刚才摆了怎样的表情啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1023_p", "source_sha256": "576d4cfbbf9a7622a8f92f23b0b9c79f0ac6db5e58d53ccc270d2033df63c47d", "ja": "さっきは、よく見えなかったからさ。\nちょっとだけ見てみたいんだけど……。", "zh": "我刚才没有看清楚，\n所以想实际看一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0114_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "3dc5184c792df9818830a4627fd32b45fc4ee181c9f6109cded1e99d4e0bba1a", "ja": "だ、ダメです！　すっごくヘンな顔ですから！\nいえ、見せませんよ。やりませんってば～！", "zh": "不、不可以！那表情真的很奇怪！\n不行，我不要给你看，我绝对不会做的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
